msgid "Accepting invitation"
msgstr "Aceptando la invitación"

#: games/makao.rb:127
msgid "Ace changes suit"
msgstr "El as cambia el palo"

msgid "Ace changes suit lets an ace be played on any ordinary table card and opens the choice of a suit. It does not cancel a pending draw or waiting penalty. If disabled, aces only match normally. Jack requests a rank from 5 to 10 makes a played jack request one of those ranks from the next player. With it off, jacks are ordinary cards."
msgstr ""

#: games/makao.rb:82
msgid "Ace changes suit lets you start an ordinary move with an ace regardless of the table card and choose a suit. It is not a way out of a pending drawing or waiting penalty. With the option off, an ace follows the ordinary matching rule."
msgstr ""

#: games/checkers.rb:106
msgid "Across the dark squares"
msgstr ""

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Acciones"

#: games/cat_head_tail.rb:170 games/farkle.rb:366
msgid "Actions. Use the arrow keys and press Enter"
msgstr "Acciones. Usa las flechas y pulsa Enter"

#: games/cat_head_tail.rb:170
msgctxt "cat_head_tail"
msgid "Actions. Use the arrow keys and press Enter"
msgstr "Acciones. Usa las flechas y pulsa Enter"

msgid "Activate Roll, then choose a pawn on the board and press Enter, followed by its marked destination. Press P for your pawn positions, Shift+P for the opponents' pawn positions, T for the turn and Ctrl+F1 for these rules."
msgstr "Activa Lanzar, elige una ficha en el tablero y pulsa Enter; después, selecciona su casilla de destino marcada. Pulsa P para conocer las posiciones de tus fichas, Shift+P para las de los oponentes, T para saber el turno y Ctrl+F1 para consultar estas reglas."

msgid "Activate Roll, then choose a pawn on the board and press Enter, followed by its marked destination. Press T to hear whose turn it is and Ctrl+F1 for these rules."
msgstr "Activa Lanzar, elige una ficha en el tablero y pulsa Enter; después, selecciona su casilla de destino marcada. Pulsa T para escuchar de quién es el turno y Ctrl+F1 para consultar estas reglas."

