#: games/krowa.rb:109
msgid "Daily Krowa"
msgstr "Krowa diaria"

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:23
msgid "Daily Krowa and Random word end after guessing or surrendering. In a Race scored by time, the word is revealed when only one active player remains. In a Race scored by attempts, the last active player may continue up to the best solved attempt count; after a failed attempt at that count, the word is revealed. If nobody solved, it is revealed immediately. Attempts already waiting to be checked are resolved first. Observers do not block the ending. Results remain at the table."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/daily_access.rb:130
msgid "Daily Krowa availability could not be checked on the server. Please try again later. Other variants remain available."
msgstr "No se ha podido comprobar en el servidor la disponibilidad de Krowa diaria. Inténtalo de nuevo más tarde. Las demás variantes siguen disponibles."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:25
msgid "Daily Krowa can draw a word between three and nine letters long. The word is determined using server time, so if you need a different one, you would have to hack into the server and change the date. You can open Daily Krowa only once. If you guess the word, give up or leave the game, it remains unavailable to your account until the next day."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa.rb:70
msgid "Daily Krowa cannot be observed or played at another person's table."
msgstr "No puedes observar Krowa diaria ni jugarla en la mesa de otra persona."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:15
msgid "Daily Krowa is private and cannot be joined or observed. Anyone joining a Random word table becomes an observer and can follow the player's attempts without receiving an answer field. Race and Word Tower use the standard Game Room invitations and observer roles."
msgstr ""

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:20
msgid "Daily Krowa is private: nobody can join or observe it. That would make guessing it later far too easy!"
msgstr ""

#: __app.rb:2878
msgid "Daily Krowa requires a private table. Create a new private table for this variant."
msgstr "Krowa diaria requiere una mesa privada. Crea una nueva mesa privada para esta variante."

#: games/krowa_support/presentation.rb:29
msgid "Daily Krowa: a common 3-to-9-letter word selected for the Warsaw date using server time. Random word: 3 to 13 letters or a random length. Race: the same lengths and a choice between time and attempt scoring. Word Tower: random lengths from 3 to 8 without a length setting."
msgstr ""

