#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:216
msgid "Fixed Ctrl+F4 after updating Game Room without restarting ELTEN. It now labels HTTP and, during an active connection, Communications UDP relay ping separately. The relay ping is not the full delay between players."
msgstr "Se ha corregido el funcionamiento de Ctrl+F4 tras actualizar Game Room sin reiniciar ELTEN. Ahora identifica por separado el ping HTTP y, durante una conexión activa, el ping al servidor de retransmisión de Communications UDP. El ping de retransmisión no representa el retardo total entre los jugadores."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:245
msgid "Fixed a Game Room installation error caused by Unicode compatibility on some ELTEN runtimes."
msgstr "Se ha corregido un error al instalar Game Room causado por problemas de compatibilidad con Unicode en algunos entornos de ejecución de ELTEN."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:158
msgid "Fixed a bot-delay error that could stop games such as Connect Four and Tic-tac-toe."
msgstr "Se ha corregido un error en el retraso de los bots que podía interrumpir partidas de juegos como Cuatro en raya y Tres en raya."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:264
msgid "Fixed a rare Makao error with jokers enabled that could interrupt the game while checking available plays."
msgstr "Se ha corregido un error poco frecuente de Makao con los comodines activados que podía interrumpir la partida al comprobar las jugadas disponibles."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:244
msgid "Fixed an unintended serve in Axel Pong after using chat. Keys used outside the game field no longer trigger a serve."
msgstr "Se ha corregido un saque involuntario en Axel Pong después de usar el chat. Las teclas pulsadas fuera del campo de juego ya no provocan un saque."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:283
msgid "Fixed creating trade offers in Monopoly. The game should no longer get stuck after announcing that a player is preparing an offer."
msgstr ""

#: games/poker.rb:19
msgid "Fixed limit"
msgstr "Límite fijo"

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:126
msgid "Fixed mixed Polish and English text in Taboo's rules and keyboard help. Help follows the interface language, independently of the card language."
msgstr "Se ha corregido la mezcla de textos en polaco e inglés en las reglas y la ayuda del teclado de Tabú. La ayuda usa el idioma de la interfaz, independientemente del idioma de las cartas."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:112
msgid "Fixed text encoding in game settings, including a Reversi checkbox crash when Game Room and ELTEN use different interface languages."
msgstr "Se ha corregido la codificación del texto en los ajustes de los juegos, incluido un fallo en las casillas de verificación de Reversi que se producía cuando Game Room y ELTEN usaban distintos idiomas de interfaz."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:285
msgid "Fixed the card-correction and turn-replay dialogs in Taboo. In Krowa, deleted words no longer reappear after drawing another word, and Daily Krowa synchronisation now includes longer histories."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:146
msgid "Fixed the empty in-game shortcuts list opened through Ctrl+F1, including in Scrabble. It now retains the current game-field help when opening the rules."
msgstr "Se ha corregido la lista vacía de atajos de la partida que se abría con Ctrl+F1, también en Scrabble. Ahora se conserva la ayuda actual del área de juego al abrir las reglas."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:261
msgid "Fixed updates when Game Room is opened from another window, such as a conference. Previously, the game could show subsequent moves only after you sent a chat message."
msgstr "Se ha corregido la actualización de la pantalla de Game Room cuando se abre desde otra ventana, como una conferencia. Antes, la partida podía mostrar los siguientes movimientos solo después de enviar un mensaje al chat."

#: games/battleship.rb:115
msgid "Fleet"
msgstr "Flota"

msgid "Flip has a light and a dark side. A Flip card turns every hand and both piles over, reversing the pile order. Light uses Draw One and Wild Draw Two; dark uses Draw Five, Skip Everyone and wild colour drawing, as well as its own colours. The active side determines what matches and what a card does. This implementation's action-card scoring remains 20 for coloured and 50 for wild cards on either side."
msgstr ""

#: games/uno.rb:113
msgid "Flip uses two-sided cards. Playing Flip turns every hand and both piles over and reverses the pile order. The light side has Draw One and Wild Draw Two; the dark side has its own colours, Draw Five, Skip Everyone and wild colour drawing. Only the active side determines matching and effects. Game Room counts coloured action cards as 20 and wild cards as 50 on either side."
msgstr ""

