#: games/poker.rb:93
msgid "From weakest to strongest: high card; one pair; two pairs; three of a kind; straight; flush; full house; four of a kind; straight flush. A pair is two cards of one rank. A straight is five consecutive ranks, regardless of suit; a flush is five cards of one suit. A full house combines three of one rank with two of another. A straight flush meets both the straight and flush conditions."
msgstr ""

#: games/yahtzee.rb:18
msgid "Full house"
msgstr "Full"

msgid "Full house is three equal dice and a pair of another value: it scores the greater of 25 and the total of all dice. A small straight is at least four consecutive different values and scores 30; a large straight is five consecutive values and scores 40. Yahtzee is five identical dice and scores 50."
msgstr ""

#: games/yahtzee.rb:64
msgid "Full house needs three equal dice and two of another value. It gives the larger of 25 and the sum of all dice. Thus 6, 6, 6, 4, 4 gives 26, while a lower full house still gives 25. Five equal dice are Yahtzee and give 50 in that row; they are not an ordinary full house."
msgstr ""

#: games/biblios.rb:31
msgid "Full: every other player takes a card"
msgstr "Completa: cada uno de los demás jugadores toma una carta"

#: games/scrabble_ui.rb:74
msgid "G: choose tiles to exchange; Space selects and Enter confirms in that list."
msgstr "G: elige las fichas que quieres intercambiar; en esa lista, Espacio selecciona y Enter confirma."

#: games/monopoly.rb:126
msgid "G: during an auction, accept the suggested bid."
msgstr "G: durante una subasta, acepta la puja sugerida."

msgid "G: exchange; arrows browse, Space selects, Enter confirms, Escape cancels. P: pass. Passing or exchanging asks before discarding a draft. E: tile counts. S: scores. T: turn. Submit or cancel your draft before saving the game."
msgstr "G: cambiar fichas; las flechas recorren la lista, Espacio selecciona, Enter confirma y Escape cancela. P: pasar. Al pasar o cambiar fichas se pide confirmación antes de descartar una jugada provisional. E: cantidad de fichas. S: puntuaciones. T: turno. Confirma o cancela tu jugada provisional antes de guardar la partida."

