msgid "Game Room history"
msgstr "Historial de Game Room"

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:24
msgid "Game Room notifications use their own notice sound. Joining a table also clears invitations and notifications for that table."
msgstr "Las notificaciones de Game Room utilizan su propio sonido de aviso. Al unirte a una mesa, también se borran las invitaciones y notificaciones de esa mesa."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:259
msgid "Game Room now keeps regular games running while you use other ELTEN windows, such as Messages or the forum. Opponents' moves, bot actions and turn timers no longer wait for you to return to the game."
msgstr "Game Room mantiene ahora en marcha las partidas de los juegos convencionales mientras usas otras ventanas de ELTEN, como Mensajes o el foro. Las jugadas de los adversarios, las acciones de los bots y los temporizadores de turno ya no esperan a que vuelvas a la partida."

#: games/spades.rb:213
msgid "Game Room supports three to six players. Three players receive 17 cards each after removing one two; four receive 13 from the full deck; five receive 10 after removing two twos; six receive eight after removing all twos. Cards rank from two up to ace. The dealer rotates, and the next player starts both bidding and the first trick."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_widget.rb:41
msgid "Game Room tables"
msgstr "Mesas de Game Room"

#: lib/game_room_widget.rb:213 lib/game_room_widget.rb:244
msgid "Game Room tables could not be loaded. Press R to retry."
msgstr "No se han podido cargar las mesas de Game Room. Pulsa R para volver a intentarlo."

#: games/biblios.rb:56
msgid "Game Room uses 87 cards: 45 category cards, 18 Gold cards and 24 Church cards. Before play, the game removes two Gold cards of each value and 21 random cards for two players, one Gold card of each value and 12 random cards for three, or seven random cards for four. You do not know the random removals, so not every card is guaranteed to appear."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:156
msgid "Game Room uses server time for invitation validity and shared deadlines. Game and chat history follows the server's event order, so different computer clocks no longer put those entries in a different order."
msgstr "Game Room usa la hora del servidor para la validez de las invitaciones y los plazos compartidos. El historial de la partida y del chat sigue el orden de los eventos del servidor, de modo que las diferencias entre los relojes de los ordenadores ya no alteran el orden de las entradas."

#: games/tic_tac_toe.rb:34
msgid "Game Room uses this 3 by 3 version without additional rule variants. You may play against another person or a bot."
msgstr ""

msgid "Game and room updates are received even while a key is held or text is being typed. Chat text, cursor position and selection remain unchanged."
msgstr "Las actualizaciones de la partida y de la sala se reciben incluso mientras mantienes pulsada una tecla o escribes texto. El texto del chat, la posición del cursor y la selección no cambian."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:20
msgid "Game and room updates are received even while a key is held or text is being typed. This should prevent games from occasionally getting stuck. Chat text, cursor position and selection remain unchanged."
msgstr "Las actualizaciones del juego y de la sala se reciben incluso mientras mantienes una tecla pulsada o escribes texto. Esto debería evitar que las partidas se bloqueen ocasionalmente. El texto del chat, la posición del cursor y la selección no cambian."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:260
msgid "Game announcements and sounds also reach you while another window covers the game. This includes the waiting room: participants joining and leaving, the start of a game and the table closing."
msgstr "Los anuncios y sonidos de la partida también se oyen mientras otra ventana cubre el juego. Esto incluye la sala de espera: la entrada y salida de participantes, el inicio de una partida y el cierre de la mesa."

