msgid "Manage properties on your own turn before rolling, or when resolving your debt. Build only in a complete colour group without mortgages. Construction must be even: add to a street with the fewest buildings in its group. Four houses can become one hotel, represented as the fifth building level. You cannot pile hotels onto one street while its neighbours remain undeveloped."
