msgid "Mouse movement works only while the Pong playfield and the ELTEN window are active. The pointer is kept near the centre of that window so the screen edge does not stop you. Chat, help, another application or a lost connection suspends mouse control. Returning to play discards movement made elsewhere. This option adds no graphics and changes no Windows mouse settings. M switches it off again."
