#: games/checkers.rb:74
msgid "Promote immediately during a capture sequence"
msgstr "Coronar de inmediato durante una secuencia de capturas"

msgid "Promote immediately during a capture sequence is off by default: promotion is evaluated at the end of the move. When enabled, reaching the last row during a capture changes the man into a king immediately, and further captures use king rules. All eight rule checkboxes describe independent choices except for the stated capture dependencies."
msgstr ""

msgid "Promote immediately during a capture sequence is off by default: promotion is evaluated at the end of the move. When enabled, reaching the last row during a capture changes the man into a king immediately, and further captures use king rules. The rule checkboxes describe independent choices except for the stated capture dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: games/checkers.rb:118
msgid "Promotion normally happens at the end of a move. Promote immediately during a capture sequence changes this: a man reaching the last row during a jump becomes a king straight away and continues using king movement. This option is off by default."
msgstr ""

