#: games/monopoly.rb:143
msgid "Put unsold properties up for auction"
msgstr "Subastar las propiedades que no se compren"

#: games/monopoly.rb:66
msgid "Put unsold properties up for auction is off by default. Turn it on if you want a declined purchase to be offered to the active players through bidding. Players take turns bidding or passing. Passing withdraws you from this auction. The remaining highest bidder pays their final bid and receives the property; the printed purchase price is not the amount automatically charged."
msgstr ""

msgid "Put unsold properties up for auction is off by default. When enabled, declining a purchase begins an auction among active players. Bid or pass in order; a player who passes leaves that auction. The winner pays the final bid and takes the property. With the option off, an unbought property simply stays available."
msgstr ""

#: games/makao.rb:131
msgid "Queen is universal"
msgstr "La reina es universal"

msgid "Queen is universal allows a queen to start a normal move regardless of the table card. A queen does not defend against a pending penalty. Use two jokers adds two cards which can represent any ordinary or special card; choose the represented card when playing. A joker defending a penalty must represent a card that can actually defend it, not an arbitrary card. Representing an ace or king uses its enabled special effect."
msgstr ""

#: games/scientific_war.rb:53
msgid "Queen, spy: in the next trick, the player who played a queen chooses last and first hears the cards the others have chosen. If two or more queens are played in the same trick, they cancel each other out."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quick table creation"
msgstr "Creación rápida de mesas"

#: games/spades.rb:519
msgid "Quicksand"
msgstr "Arenas movedizas"

msgid "Quicksand changes regular contract scoring. An exact contract gives 10 times the bid. Every overtrick costs 10 points, and a missed contract costs 10 points for every missing trick. There are no persistent bags. Nil still gives or costs 100 points, but a failed nil creates no bags."
msgstr ""

#: games/spades.rb:227
msgid "Quicksand replaces the normal contract calculation. An exact contract gives ten times the bid, each extra trick subtracts ten, and a missed contract costs ten for each missing trick. There are no accumulated bags or the normal small- and large-contract bonuses. Nil still gives or costs 100. This option is off by default."
msgstr ""

#: games/spades.rb:450
msgid "Quicksand scoring"
msgstr "Puntuación de Arenas movedizas"

#: games/quiz_party.rb:54
msgid "Quiz Party"
msgstr "Quiz Party"

#: games/quiz_party.rb:81
msgid "Quiz Party is for two to eight participants, with bots available. Each question has four proposed answers and one is marked correct in the question set. Everyone answers independently. Use the arrows to choose an answer and Enter to submit it. Your submission is final for that question and stays hidden until the answering period closes."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:13
msgid "Quiz Party no longer stops while preparing the next question when clients receive slightly different timestamps for the same LiveSessions entry."
msgstr "Quiz Party ya no se detiene al preparar la siguiente pregunta cuando los clientes reciben marcas de tiempo ligeramente distintas para la misma entrada de LiveSessions."

msgid "Quiz keys"
msgstr "Atajos de Quiz Party"

#: games/poker.rb:90
msgid "R asks for the raise above the call, not the total number of chips you will pay. If you owe 20 and enter 30, you pay 50: 20 to call and 30 to raise. The minimum full raise is the size of the previous full raise, starting from the big-blind unit. With nothing to call, the entered amount is your opening bet. An amount outside the allowed range is rejected without placing a bet."
msgstr ""

msgid "R opens an amount field in both variants. Enter the raise above the call, not the total payment. The prompt gives the allowed raise and total-payment ranges. With no bet to call, the entered amount is the opening bet. Escape cancels."
msgstr "R abre un campo de importe en ambas variantes. Introduce la subida por encima del importe para igualar, no el pago total. El mensaje indica los intervalos permitidos para la subida y el pago total. Si no hay ninguna apuesta que igualar, el importe introducido es la apuesta inicial. Escape cancela."

