#: games/quiz_party.rb:91
msgid "Reaching the target does not cut short a round. Finish all three questions, then the highest score wins. If the highest scores are equal, play another complete round and check again, continuing until one player leads. Bots sometimes know an answer and otherwise guess; adding one does not make every answer perfect. Saving a partly played Quiz Party match is not supported."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reaching the target with unbanked turn points is not enough: you must bank them. A Farkle loses only the current turn's unbanked points, not points saved in earlier turns. The first-bank minimum applies while your saved score is zero; after a successful first bank the ordinary minimum applies."
