#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:63
msgid "Resuming preserves the game, settings, bots and remaining turn time, and waits for the original players. Quiz Party and Categories cannot be saved; UNO requires finishing the colour choice and Monopoly requires finishing the auction. Private and resumed tables require an up-to-date Game Room for all players."
