msgid "Scrabble is for two to four people, with Polish and English word lists, a keyboard-operated board, a private move draft and configurable invalid-word penalties. Polish uses SJP and English uses Wordnik; these are not the official tournament word lists. There are no bots."
msgstr "Scrabble permite jugar de dos a cuatro personas, con listas de palabras en polaco e inglés, un tablero que se maneja con el teclado, un borrador privado del movimiento y penalizaciones configurables por palabras no válidas. El polaco usa SJP y el inglés usa Wordnik; no son las listas oficiales de palabras para torneos. No hay bots."

msgid "Scrabble is for two to four people, without bots. Each rack holds seven tiles. The first word covers H8; later words connect to the crossword, including parallel words. Place new tiles in one row or column without empty gaps. Every newly formed word, including crosswords, must be in the selected local dictionary. Words contain two to fifteen letters. Committed tiles never move."
