#: games/biblios.rb:498
msgid "The cards are dealt and the Gift phase begins."
msgstr "Se han repartido las cartas y comienza la fase de donaciones."

msgid "The categories are country, city, name, animal, plant and thing. Their labels follow each player's interface language, while the selected answer language determines the letters used in the match."
