msgstr "No hay contactos conectados a los que puedas invitar."

#: __app.rb:1630
msgid "There are no online users available to invite."
msgstr "No hay usuarios conectados a los que puedas invitar."

#: __app.rb:1035
msgid "There are no open tables for this game."
msgstr "No hay mesas abiertas para este juego."

#: __app.rb:990
msgid "There are no open tables."
msgstr "No hay mesas abiertas."

#: games/four_in_a_row.rb:35
msgid "There are no optional board sizes or alternative placement rules in this game. Either player can be a bot."
msgstr ""

#: __app.rb:1737
msgid "There are no pending invitations."
msgstr "No hay invitaciones pendientes."

#: games/makao.rb:176
msgid "There are not enough cards to deal this many cards to every player."
msgstr "No hay suficientes cartas para repartir esa cantidad a cada jugador."

#: games/three_five_eight.rb:81
msgid "There are six contracts: hearts, spades, diamonds and clubs as trump, no trump, and misere. During the game every player must choose each contract exactly once. The dealer moves one seat after every deal, so the complete game has 18 deals."
msgstr ""

msgid "There are three lanes, one for each shot sound. After the opponent hits a new ball, Up arrow or W selects the first lane, Left arrow or D the second, and Down arrow or S the third. You only need to press once for that incoming flight. After releasing the key, you stay in the selected lane. If the ball matches that lane, you defend automatically when it is no more than two steps from your end. You do not need to hold the key or press it again at contact."
msgstr ""

msgid "There are three lanes, one for each shot sound. Up arrow or W selects the first lane, Left arrow or D the second, and Down arrow or S the third. You only need to press once. After releasing the key, you stay in the selected lane. If the incoming ball matches that lane, you defend automatically when it is no more than two steps from your end. You do not need to hold the key or press it again at contact."
msgstr ""

msgid "There are two separate totals: your banked score and the points you are collecting in the current turn. The turn starts with zero points. Choose Roll to throw the die, or Bank to add the current turn total to your banked score and pass play to the next person. You may also bank zero or a negative total; a negative bank lowers your score."
msgstr ""

msgid "There is a five-second break between sets. The game announces the first set, second set and later sets, together with the server. Shift+S reads points and won sets; T reads the server and connection status. Unfinished Audio Ball matches cannot be saved."
msgstr ""

#: games/audio_ball.rb:212
msgid "There is a short break before the next serve after an ordinary point, and a five-second break between sets. The game automatically announces the set number and who is serving. You do not need to request these announcements."
msgstr ""

