#: games/mancala.rb:78
msgid "Up / Down: change rows."
msgstr "Arriba / abajo: cambia de fila."

msgid "Up and Down: browse scoring combinations, Roll and Bank in one list. Enter: perform the selected action."
msgstr "Arriba y abajo: recorre las combinaciones que puntúan, Lanzar y Guardar puntos en una sola lista. Enter: realiza la acción seleccionada."

#: games/audio_ball.rb:192
msgid "Up arrow or W corresponds to the first shot type, Left arrow or D to the second, and Down arrow or S to the third. Use the same key to defend against a shot type or to choose it for your own attack."
msgstr ""

msgid "Up arrow or W, Left arrow or D, and Down arrow or S choose three different shots. To defend an incoming shot, press its matching key when the ball is no more than two steps from your end. Pressing too early or using the wrong key does nothing and does not immediately lose the point; you can still press the correct key in time. If the ball passes you without a valid defence, the opponent scores."
msgstr ""

msgid "Up arrow or W, Left arrow or D, and Down arrow or S choose three different shots. To defend an incoming shot, press its matching key when the ball is no more than two steps from your end. You can also hold one matching key as it approaches: defense occurs only in those final two steps. A quick press released too early is not saved for later. A wrong key does not immediately lose the point; you can still use the correct key in time. If the ball passes you without a valid defence, the opponent scores."
msgstr ""

msgid "Up arrow or W: first shot or matching defense."
msgstr "Flecha arriba o W: primer tipo de golpe o defensa correspondiente."

msgid "Up arrow or W: make the first shot, or defend the matching incoming shot."
msgstr "Flecha arriba o W: realiza el primer tipo de golpe o defiende el golpe entrante correspondiente."

#: games/audio_ball.rb:219 lib/game_surfaces/audio_ball_surface.rb:104
msgid "Up arrow: choose a defence against the first shot type, or play that shot after preparing."
msgstr "Flecha arriba: elige una defensa contra el primer tipo de golpe o realiza ese golpe después de prepararte."

msgid "Up arrow: make the first shot, or defend the matching incoming shot."
msgstr "Flecha arriba: realiza el primer tipo de golpe o defiende el golpe entrante correspondiente."

msgid "Up arrow: select the first lane for this incoming ball, or make the first shot after preparing."
msgstr "Flecha arriba: selecciona el primer carril para esta pelota entrante o realiza el primer tipo de golpe después de prepararte."

msgid "Up arrow: select the first lane, or make the first shot after preparing."
msgstr "Flecha arriba: selecciona el primer carril o realiza el primer tipo de golpe después de prepararte."

#: games/axel_pong.rb:287 lib/game_surfaces/pong_surface.rb:65
msgid "Up arrow: serve or return the ball."
msgstr "Flecha arriba: sacar o devolver la pelota."

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:241
msgid "Updated Krowa's rules, with descriptions of its modes and controls in Polish and English."
msgstr "Se han actualizado las reglas de Krowa, con descripciones de sus modos y controles en polaco e inglés."

