msgid "You are imprisoned only when a field, a card or three consecutive doubles sends you there. Simply stopping on the jail field is a visit. Before a prison roll, you may pay the exit fee or use a held jail card. Otherwise you have up to three turns to roll doubles. Successful doubles release you and move you by the roll, without an extra turn. After the third failed attempt, you pay and move by that roll."
