#: games/uno.rb:97
msgid "You want as few points as possible. The round winner receives zero; everyone else adds the value of cards still held. Number cards count their number, coloured action cards 20 and wild cards 50. The elimination limit is normally 500, configurable from 50 to 5000. Players reaching it leave after the round, while the others continue. The last remaining player wins the whole game."
msgstr ""

